+- **Waking Up.**
+  - Sensor Tower data cited secondhand: about 20,000 monthly downloads and about $700k monthly revenue on iOS (early 2026, estimate) — [builtbyfoundry blog](https://www.builtbyfoundry.io/blog/sam-harris-waking-up-meditation-app-empire). No company subscriber figure was found.
+  - App operator: Waking Up Course, LLC — [App Store](https://apps.apple.com/us/app/waking-up-meditation-wisdom/id1307736395). A search summary associates it with Project Reason, Inc. (unconfirmed).
